{"title": "Cunning Brume", "pageid": 28489, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Cunning_Brume", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Cunning Brume</b> is a passive feature that creates a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fog\" title=\"Fog\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Fog_cloud_Icon.webp/20px-Fog_cloud_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Fog_cloud_Icon.webp/30px-Fog_cloud_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Fog_cloud_Icon.webp/40px-Fog_cloud_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"cloud\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Fog_cloud_Icon.webp/20px-Fog_cloud_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dc/Fog_cloud_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fog\" title=\"Fog\">cloud</a> at the wearer's feet when they disengage.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When the wearer <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disengage\" title=\"Disengage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Disengage_Icon.webp/20px-Disengage_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Disengage_Icon.webp/30px-Disengage_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Disengage_Icon.webp/40px-Disengage_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disengages\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Disengage_Icon.webp/20px-Disengage_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Disengage_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disengage\" title=\"Disengage\">Disengages</a>, they also create a foggy cloud with 2 m (7 ft) radius that lasts for 1 turn. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cloak_of_Cunning_Brume\" title=\"Cloak of Cunning Brume\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Cloak_of_Cunning_Brume_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Cloak_of_Cunning_Brume_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Cloak_of_Cunning_Brume_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Cloak_of_Cunning_Brume_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Cloak_of_Cunning_Brume_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Cloak_of_Cunning_Brume_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Cloak_of_Cunning_Brume_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Cloak_of_Cunning_Brume_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Cloak_of_Cunning_Brume_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Cloak_of_Cunning_Brume\" title=\"Cloak of Cunning Brume\">Cloak of Cunning Brume</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The effect produces a miniature <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fog\" title=\"Fog\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Fog_cloud_Icon.webp/20px-Fog_cloud_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Fog_cloud_Icon.webp/30px-Fog_cloud_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Fog_cloud_Icon.webp/40px-Fog_cloud_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"fog cloud\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Fog_cloud_Icon.webp/20px-Fog_cloud_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dc/Fog_cloud_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fog\" title=\"Fog\">fog cloud</a>, obscuring and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinded (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"blinding\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinded (Condition)\">blinding</a> all creatures within. This makes it very useful for thievery and getting <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on enemies threatening the user.</li>\n<li>This effect triggers when using one of the disengage actions:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cunning_Action:_Disengage\" title=\"Cunning Action: Disengage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Disengage_Bonus_Action_Icon.webp/20px-Disengage_Bonus_Action_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Disengage_Bonus_Action_Icon.webp/30px-Disengage_Bonus_Action_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Disengage_Bonus_Action_Icon.webp/40px-Disengage_Bonus_Action_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cunning Action: Disengage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Disengage_Bonus_Action_Icon.webp/20px-Disengage_Bonus_Action_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Disengage_Bonus_Action_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cunning_Action:_Disengage\" title=\"Cunning Action: Disengage\">Cunning Action: Disengage</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disengage\" title=\"Disengage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Disengage_Icon.webp/20px-Disengage_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Disengage_Icon.webp/30px-Disengage_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Disengage_Icon.webp/40px-Disengage_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disengage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Disengage_Icon.webp/20px-Disengage_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Disengage_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disengage\" title=\"Disengage\">Disengage</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disengage:_Bonus_Action\" title=\"Disengage: Bonus Action\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Disengage_Bonus_Action_Icon.webp/20px-Disengage_Bonus_Action_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Disengage_Bonus_Action_Icon.webp/30px-Disengage_Bonus_Action_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Disengage_Bonus_Action_Icon.webp/40px-Disengage_Bonus_Action_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disengage: Bonus Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Disengage_Bonus_Action_Icon.webp/20px-Disengage_Bonus_Action_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Disengage_Bonus_Action_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disengage:_Bonus_Action\" title=\"Disengage: Bonus Action\">Disengage: Bonus Action</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Step_of_the_Wind:_Disengage\" title=\"Step of the Wind: Disengage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6e/Step_of_the_Wind_Disengage_Icon.webp/20px-Step_of_the_Wind_Disengage_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6e/Step_of_the_Wind_Disengage_Icon.webp/30px-Step_of_the_Wind_Disengage_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6e/Step_of_the_Wind_Disengage_Icon.webp/40px-Step_of_the_Wind_Disengage_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Step of the Wind: Disengage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6e/Step_of_the_Wind_Disengage_Icon.webp/20px-Step_of_the_Wind_Disengage_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6e/Step_of_the_Wind_Disengage_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Step_of_the_Wind:_Disengage\" title=\"Step of the Wind: Disengage\">Step of the Wind: Disengage</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>It <i>does not</i> trigger when disengaging through <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cautious_Healer\" title=\"Cautious Healer\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cautious Healer\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cautious_Healer\" title=\"Cautious Healer\">Cautious Healer</a></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201625\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.071 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.079 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3289/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 27060/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10883/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 27/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.039/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 993591/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   69.185      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   69.185      1 -total\n 29.79%   20.609      1 Template:PageSeo\n 29.36%   20.310      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 28.75%   19.891      2 Template:SmArea\n 26.19%   18.119     10 Template:Icon_link\n 24.88%   17.212     10 Te